# The project watcher's settings here (`Flixbox/household-brain#241`), read by the plugin's monitor and by
# `bun --env-file=.claude/watcher.env`; the environment still wins. OWNER (the owner's login, whose
# approval counts) is no login written here (#1060): export it first, looked up as AGENTS.md shows.
# Without it the watcher takes the repository's owner, the organisation, and no approval counts.
# The agent works on GitHub as the bot (see AGENTS.md).
REPO=Coarisfinia/khovax
WORKFLOW=ci.yml
GH=agent-gh
ACTIVITY_GH=gh
SELF=coarisfinia-ai-agent[bot]
# Dismiss a bot's change request (any login ending in [bot], here CodeRabbit's) once the owner
# approved, CI is green and every review thread is settled: one left on an older commit, or one on
# the head once `Resolved:` replies settled it (#1551, `Flixbox/household-brain#285`,
# `Flixbox/household-brain#290`). It reports REVIEW_DISMISSED. A person's is never dismissed.
DISMISS_STALE_BOT_REVIEWS=1
